OL,3,GNEWSA'It's the child they educate ` not
OL,4,Apiercings or hair'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo families are considering taking
OL,7,Ftheir children out of school after they
OL,8,Fwere punished for their uniform.
OL,10,FAlex started in Year 7 at Thomas
OL,11,FMiddlecott Academy in Kirton, Boston,
OL,12,Fon 3 September, and was taken aside
OL,13,Fafter about 10 minutes and told her
OL,14,Fshoes were not suitable.
OL,16,FKC started in Year 9 at the same
OL,17,FLincolnshire school on 4 September, and
OL,18,Fsaid she was taken straight to an
OL,19,Fisolation room for having a clear nose
OL,20,Fstud and some hair dye that had not
OL,21,Ffully come out.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
