OL,3,GNEWSA'It's the child they educate ` not
OL,4,Apiercings or hair'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the academy said it
OL,7,Fencouraged parents to contact them
OL,8,Fdirectly to discuss concerns, and it
OL,9,Fsaid its uniform guidelines were shared
OL,10,Fwith families at the end of the summer
OL,11,Fterm.
